	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010030d"},
		line=777,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After exchanging contact information with Kotone, the three of us leave the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Elated about the memorial service, Hotori has been in high spirits ever since.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks for taking me home.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Aren't we lucky to have met Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I never thought I'd live to see you cry.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, hush.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee. Aren't you just adorable.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Leave me alone.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Hotori grumbles with a pout.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, you at least understand how I feel, right?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What an honor it is for the Exalt-Priestess to personally perform a memorial service.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course I do. Sorry for making fun of you.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Honestly.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"She crosses her arms and turns away in a huff.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"It's not every day that I get to see such an endearing side of her.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well then, I'll call you when I figure out a day for the service.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Hotori nods lightly, then directs her gaze at Akari.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't you dare get Soujin caught up in any danger.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh!?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Hotori turns to wave at just me before slipping into a nearby alleyway.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"She has to be wary of being followed, so she can't head straight home.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wouldn't you normally say that to the guy?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Apparently she doesn't like that you were there for the raid yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was totally out of my control, though!”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're not wrong. I just won't bring you along next time.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"I start the engine.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou still isn't opening up to me.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I suppose that's too much to ask until I can prove my lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“About that, I came up with an idea earlier.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believe you've been wearing an Artifact. Has it been appraised before?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if there was a certificate of authenticity, it's probably in the Imperial Palace, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I get it. You want Kotone to appraise it, right?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"I nod in reply.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"According to Akari, that Artifact has been passed down in the Imperial Family for generations.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we can prove it's a treasure of the Imperial Family, we can prove its owner's lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wouldn't she just think I stole it?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Such a high-class Artifact should have a record of all its previous owners.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If it were ever stolen, that fact would have been recorded.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"High-class Artifacts are so significant that even if they are kept as private property, their ownership is strictly regulated.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"As such, information regarding their ownership is publicly available.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, I guess it wouldn't hurt to get it appraised.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If it has the Exalt-Priestess's seal of approval, even Hotori might change her tune.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I never imagined I'd ever be relying on Kotone for help.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Akari smiles at the strangeness of her circumstances.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“?!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Akari ducks for cover.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I glance out the window and spot a group of five or six Imperial Police standing with their guns raised.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I follow their gaze and see a man collapsed on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"He must have been shot dead for resisting.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I don't step on the brakes.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Even as the shame boils up inside me, I continue picking up speed.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Akari doesn't oppose me as before.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Out of the corner of my eye, I can see her biting her lip hard enough to draw blood.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Whether this is her personal growth, or her merely learning the ways of the world, I know not.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"All I know is that I am a failure for having made my lord feel this way.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have you still not given up on assassinating Okonogi?”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Akari continues staring out her window in silence.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If things continue as they are, we'll become desensitized to even the most horrible of sights.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Before we know it, this'll become the new normal, and the past will be but a distant memory.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We have to rise up before it's too late.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"She is no fool. She should know perfectly well that there would be no future beyond the assassination.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"But Akari still says nothing, continuing to stare out her window.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? You passed by the shop...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's stay out a little longer.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I want to have a nice, long talk tonight.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In the Republic, I hear they call this kind of outing a ≪drive.≫”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're not acting like yourself. What gives?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to know why you're so fixated on such a reckless assassination plot.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's not any of your business.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Pull over already. Let me out.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We both know that's not true. Your actions have the potential to affect the future of the entire Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I ignore her and speed up.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, hey! Let me out!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just the other day, you refused to get out no matter what I said.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And this is your idea of payback?!”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You sure are one petty guy.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're not going to like what I have to say anyway. Go ahead and get it out of your system early.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaaah, this jerk! Grrr...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"After a considerable amount of griping, Akari eventually slumps down in her seat.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I did just sour her temper, so I should at least take us somewhere with a nice view.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why will you not give up on the assassination?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if Okonogi dies, the current system won't change one bit.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All I want is to avenge my mother.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So you would forsake every last one of your subjects for the sake of your own petty vengeance?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"If my lord is truly such a person, then I am most unfortunate indeed.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let me ask a different question.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even if you were to succeed, what would you do then? Spend the rest of your days plowing the fields in Iseya?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Akari doesn't meet my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"She impassively stares into the distance, her face an expressionless mask.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll die.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As long as my plan succeeds, I don't intend to live beyond that.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"There is nothing heroic about her expression.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"She speaks of her own death as though she's talking about her plans for the weekend.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know this assassination won't change the system.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But I never had any ambitions to do that in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll avenge my mother's death, then take my own life.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That is all I've ever been after.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"I'm at a loss for words.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Images of Akari's lifeless face swirl about in my mind over and over.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"A car in the opposite lane narrowly whizzes by, but I don't even react in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Never in all my life have I felt so stricken, and I can't help myself.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Eyes on the road.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I face forward silently.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why would you choose death?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Because that is my duty.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"I cannot comprehend.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Why must she whom I revere as my lord invite her own death?",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I am the last of the Imperial Family. I must take responsibility for our defeat in the war.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We lost because of the warriors' incompetence.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We already went over this at Miyoshi, didn't we?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The warriors fighting on the battlefield share no blame. Taking responsibility is our family's duty.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Akari did say just that.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"The conversation ended with the matter unsettled, but Akari was completely serious at the time.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To be entrusted by Oomikami to protect the land's harvests and the country's peace─ that is the Imperial\nFamily's purpose.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Should we ever fail to uphold this sacred duty, we are to offer our own lives to beg Oomikami's forgiveness.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This creed has been passed down through countless generations in the Imperial Family.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Check the history books, and you'll find a new Emperor after every plague or famine.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I've forgotten the history I learned from before the war, but I at least re-learned the genealogy of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"And indeed, as she says, after every major calamity that threatened to topple the Empire, a new Emperor acceded to the throne.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For the Imperial Family, there could be no graver sin than allowing our own country to be conquered.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If there was ever a reason to lay down my life for\nOomikami's forgiveness, now would be it.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Every day I continue to draw breath is a grave insult to my ancestors.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Akari doesn't appear to be drunk on her own destiny.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Her expression is calm and composed to the very end.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, ever since the war, the only reason I've kept myself alive is for the sake of penance.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's why we'll never see eye to eye. Because we're living for two completely different purposes.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All of your lectures were doomed to fail from the very beginning.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"It seems like I've been underestimating Akari all this time.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Did I really think, deep down, that she would eventually bend to my will?",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Did I really let my guard down, thinking her a simple, reckless girl with more passion than she knew what to do with?",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That answer your questions?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Akari gives me a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"It's a smile that sees straight through to my heart of hearts.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It did.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Once we kill Okonogi, maybe I'll have you do the honors.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Akari murmurs softly, her voice tinged with self-deprecation.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"To execute one's own lord is the greatest defeat a warrior can suffer.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"It must never be allowed to happen.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ghhk!?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"I'm wracked with an intense headache.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"The pain feels as though my brain is being squeezed in a tofu press.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I somehow manage to stomp on the brakes and pull over by the side of the road.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you okay?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be fine!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Akari retracts the hand she was reaching toward me.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Following it with my gaze, I look straight into her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will not allow you to die.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"I cradle my splitting head, barely managing to put my feelings to words.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You'd have me live with such shame?”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To abandon your vassals and run away alone is far more shameful.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not running away.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To die like this is our duty. That's how it's meant to be.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't care!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"not",
{"/font"},
" going to let you die!”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I stomp on the accelerator in place of screaming.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're a stubborn one. Seriously.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Akari regards me with a warm expression.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But my decision isn't going to change.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We need a lord who will stand with us to the very end.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Otherwise, the souls of all the warriors who have fallen will surely lose their way.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Too bad. Looks like we still can't see eye to eye.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Akari smiles wanly and looks out the window.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"The jewel-like nightscape drifts past her reflection in the glass.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“≪Drives≫ aren't so bad, once in a while...”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
		next101={ block=145, label=9 },
	},
}
